  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom and Lily look. They are in the house. Pip is not here. \"Where is he?\" asks Lily. \"Let's find him.\" \"Is he in the bathroom?\" \"No, he isn't.\" \"Is he in the bath?\" \"No, he isn't.\"",
      "\"Is he in the kitchen?\" \"No, he isn't.\" \"Is he on the bed?\" asks Lily. Tom looks. Pip is on the bed! \"Woof!\" says Pip. The dog has a sock. \"A good sock?\" asks Tom. \"No, it isn't!\" says Lily.",
      "Mom is here. She has juice and grapes. \"Are they purple?\" asks Tom. \"Yes, they are,\" says Mom. \"Juice, please,\" says Lily. \"Here you are,\" says Mom. Tom smiles. We are happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom and Lily ask yes or no questions to find Pip in the house. Pip is on the bed with a sock, and Mom has juice and grapes.",
